GROUPS = [("leg", "foot", "toe_a", "toe_b", "toe_c"), ("foot", "toe_a", "toe_b", "toe_c"), ("arm", "finger_a", "finger_b", "finger_c"), ("finger_a", "finger_b", "finger_c"), ("skull", "jaw", "nose", "brow", "ear", "lid", "horn"), ("toe_a", "toe_b", "toe_c")]


def leash_set(tubes):
    """2 November 2026 : a part keeps its structure : hidden from the silhouettes, a foot collapsed, toes wandered, a finger grew a ball at its tip, and the score rose. Each tube with a leash keeps its points near where they were measured, its radii within a ratio, its flatten near 1. FR : une partie garde sa structure : cachés des silhouettes, un pied s'est effondré, des orteils ont erré, un doigt a pris une boule au bout, et le score montait. Chaque tube en laisse garde ses points près de leur mesure, ses rayons dans un rapport, son aplatissement près de 1."""
